---
layout: page.njk
permalink: our-trips.html
title: Our Trips - Key West Pro Guides
description: "Backcountry Fishing Wreck & Reef Fishing Offshore Fishing Tarpon Fishing Shark Fishing Marquesas Atoll Fishing Gulf Wreck Fishing Gulf Tower Fishing ‘Way West’ Fishing"
h1: Our Trips
heroCls: top
heroImg: wix/95e38a_6a214e8d26744415ad91036e4f4ad434.jpg
heroAlt: Anglers holding an amberjack on a light tackle trip
ogImage: wix/95e38a_6a214e8d26744415ad91036e4f4ad434.jpg
crumbs:
  - label: Our Trips
---
<section class="sec tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="g3 trips">
      {% for t in (trips | inList("slug", tripinfo.homeOrder)) %}
      {% set from = t.rates | minPrice %}{% set hrs = t.rates | hourRange %}
      <a class="tcard" href="{{ t.url }}">
        <span class="tc-media">
          {% img t.card.img, t.card.alt, "(max-width: 700px) 100vw, (max-width: 1023px) 50vw, 400px", "" %}
          {% if from %}<span class="tc-price">From <b>{{ from | money }}</b></span>{% endif %}
        </span>
        <span class="tc-body">
          <h2 class="tc-title">{{ t.name }}</h2>
          {% if hrs %}<span class="tc-meta"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>{{ hrs }}</span>{% endif %}
          <span class="tc-blurb">{{ t.card.blurb }}</span>
          <span class="tc-foot">See trip details<span class="tc-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span>
        </span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="center" style="margin:32px 0 0">Also see <a href="/our-trips/tarpon-fishing"><strong>Tarpon Fishing</strong></a> and <a href="/fishing-info/rates"><strong>all rates</strong></a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
